# Remediator contract

Pick **one** `open` finding from `governance/findings/`. PR/commit title **must** contain `F-NNN`.

## Close a finding (all steps required)

1. Make the fix.
2. Run its `verification_script`; confirm exit 0 / `[PASS]`.
3. Update YAML: `status: closed`, `closed_at: <today>`.
4. Run `make verify` (includes Adversary + `make debt-check`).
5. One finding per PR (exception: trivial cross-cutting cleanups under 10 lines).

## Ratchet

- Open finding + broken invariant → xfail / `[GAP]` (suite stays green).
- Closed finding + regression → hard fail / `[FAIL]` (Adversary re-runs on every PR).
- Debt metric grew past baseline → hard fail / `[FAIL]` (`check_debt_ratchet.py` on every PR).
- Debt hotspots surface in `SESSION_HANDOUT.md`; promote one into a finding per `governance/CATEGORIES.md`.

Never set `status: closed` without a passing `verification_script`. Never edit `AUDIT_STATE.json` or `SESSION_HANDOUT.md` by hand.

## Scope / docs

- `PROJECT_CHARTER.md` changes require an ADR in `governance/adrs/`.
- No parallel docs: no `TODO.md`, `PLAN.md`, `ROADMAP.md`, `SRS.md`.
- Charter ≤200 lines; index ADRs in charter §7; do not duplicate normative detail.
